==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snowball]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 3.33~5.33 seconds<sup>100f~160f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ice Doge]]s spawn after 16 seconds<sup>480f</sup>, delay 20~22 seconds<sup>600f~660f</sup>.
*2 [[Vendor El]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'mammoth]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Snowball]]s spawn, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
**20 [[Snowball]]s spawn, delay 6~8 seconds<sup>180f~240f</sup>.
**1 [[Festive Otter]] spawns.
**1 [[Christmas D.]] spawns.

==Strategy==
If the cats have their [[True Form]]s achieved, that'll be an advantage to you. You must save A LOT of money, so use it wisely. Don't stop spamming your meatshields until Vendor El dies, because if you stop, Vendor would lower the attack of your cats. The rest is not a problem until you hit the base. Use the money you saved to take out stronger meatshields and attackers. It is dangerous to use short-ranged attackers, as they would probably die to Festive Otter.

Lure them near your base and send out a [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]], that'll deal with some of the enemies. Don't forget to send out other attackers too because while Bahamut is charging, he can get knocked back. Take out more wave attackers. If you have reached that far, only some Fireworks Guys and Le'mammoth must be near your base. Use long ranged attackers to defeat Le'mammoth, and the rest is no problem.

'''Following the video below''', you must have [[Cap'n Ahab (Combo)|Cap'n Ahab]] and [[Moby Dick (Combo)|Moby Dick]]. Send out a cat to defend from the [[Snowball]]s, like [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Fish Cat]]. When the Vendor Els come, spam your meatshields and wave attackers.

